    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Negotiating a conflict",
     "texto": [
      "In a discussion it is used to propose solutions: **Wir brauchen nicht nur einen Kompromiss, sondern auch Vertrauen** (we need not only a compromise but also trust). Beware of the false friend: **sondern** is not «but» in the sense of «however»; it always follows a negation."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
